fields.description:
A download URL for the CPU profile (.pprof) captured while the run was in
the given state. The profile merges every OpenTofu command of that state;
the "spacelift.command" sample label tells them apart.

inputFields.description:
Operating system for which the provider binary is built. Note that Spacelift
does not validate the correctness of the reported operating system;
Terraform will do it.
